# Contributing to Mettelo

First of all, thank you for your interest in contributing to Mettelo.

Mettelo is more than a GitHub organization—we are building a global ecosystem where data and AI professionals can learn, collaborate, build real-world solutions, and demonstrate their capabilities through meaningful contributions.

Every contribution, no matter how small, helps strengthen the community and move our mission forward.

---

# Our Mission

Our mission is to build the infrastructure that enables data and AI professionals to learn, build, prove, and grow together.

We welcome contributors from all backgrounds and experience levels. Whether you're fixing a typo, improving documentation, building an AI application, reviewing code, or mentoring another member, your contribution matters.

